  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The green house gas/es is (are):</p><p>(A) Carbon dioxide</p><p>(B) Oxygen</p><p>(C) Water vapour</p><p>(D) Methane</p><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
